    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p12_b16",
      "text": "The theory above treats a complete response as one action. This is the right abstraction\nfor the robust objective: the reward model scores completed responses, GRPO groups\ncompleted responses, and the policy-gradient update uses the sequence log-probability\n",
      "bbox": [
        71.58,
        662.24,
        523.73,
        710.06
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        286,
        2648,
